#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_web_scraper_highway
msgid ""
"\n"
"Highway Toll Prepayment\n"
"=======================\n"
"\n"
"Collects toll-tag balances, crossings and monthly statements from the Mexican\n"
"prepaid toll portals, and books each crossing against the vehicle it belongs to.\n"
"\n"
"* One account per portal login, with its credential held by the encrypted vault.\n"
"* Tags carry their transponder number and the vehicle asset they are fitted to.\n"
"* Crossings, balance snapshots and statements are deduplicated per account, so a\n"
"  re-import of the same export changes nothing.\n"
"* PASE is implemented, through CSV exports for every account and through\n"
"  scheduled reads of the enterprise API for accounts holding a browser session.\n"
"  IAVE, Televia and ViaPass are declared and seeded but have no scraper yet.\n"
"\n"
"The repository README documents the PASE workflows, its correctness audit and\n"
"the limits of its automatic login.\n"
msgstr ""

