#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_mcp_server
msgid ""
"\n"
"MCP Server\n"
"==========\n"
"\n"
"Exposes Odoo to Model Context Protocol clients.\n"
"\n"
"Routes\n"
"------\n"
"* ``POST /mcp`` -- the Model Context Protocol itself, JSON-RPC 2.0 over one\n"
"  endpoint. Point a client at this and nothing else is needed.\n"
"* ``/mcp/health``, ``/mcp/system/info`` -- service probes\n"
"* ``/mcp/auth/validate`` -- API key validation\n"
"* ``/mcp/models``, ``/mcp/models/<model>/access`` -- enabled models and the\n"
"  operations allowed on them\n"
"\n"
"Models\n"
"------\n"
"* ``mcp.endpoint`` -- the master switch, the quota and the address allowlist\n"
"* the ``mcp`` API key scope's lines -- per-model, per-operation permissions,\n"
"  and the columns MCP must never touch\n"
"* ``mcp.dispatcher`` -- the protocol handler and the tools it offers\n"
"* every call is an ``integration.exchange`` row of the endpoint\n"
"\n"
"Authentication uses Odoo API keys, with rate limiting. Any Model Context\n"
"Protocol client can speak to ``POST /mcp`` directly; no companion package is\n"
"required.\n"
msgstr ""

